{%- comment -%}
  Paste this into the TRMNL Private Plugin "Markup" editor for the
  bus-grabo plugin (Polling strategy), "Full" tab.

  Two single-line "next bus" countdowns (not a multi-departure list - see
  fetch.mjs's nextDeparture()), for the same physical route observed at two
  points: Mjörn (towards Gråbo) and Gråbo busstation (towards Göteborg).

  Every text line uses "label" so size/font stays identical and pixelated
  throughout (see README's "Markup style" section) - matches the previous
  version's convention.

  Position map: a single generated PNG (bus_position.map_image_url) showing
  Sjövik -- Mjörn -- Gråbo as three dots on a line, with a marker for each
  departure's live GPS-derived position along that stretch (see fetch.mjs's
  renderPositionMap()/resolveRoute()/describeDeparturePosition()). Rules
  learned the hard way in weather-yr apply here too: this <img> uses
  class="image image--contain image-dither" (not just "image"), and it is
  a single LONE <img> - never placed as a flex sibling of another <img> -
  so it gets its own row.

  Bus name + live location for each departure are shown at the bottom
  (mjorn_to_grabo.bus_name/bus_location, grabo_to_goteborg.bus_name/
  bus_location) - these come from matching the departure to a live GPS fix
  by detailsReference; see fetch.mjs's describeDeparturePosition() for what
  each possible bus_location string means (unknown/off-route/etc).
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="layout layout--col gap--medium">

  <div class="layout layout--row layout--center-x">
    <img class="image image--contain image-dither" src="{{ bus_position.map_image_url }}" width="480" height="56" style="width: 480px; height: 56px;">
  </div>

  <div class="layout layout--row" style="justify-content: space-between;">
    <div class="label">Sjövik</div>
    <div class="label">Mjörn</div>
    <div class="label">Gråbo</div>
  </div>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <div class="label">{{ mjorn_to_grabo.label }}:</div>
  {% if mjorn_to_grabo.has_departure %}
  <div class="label">{{ mjorn_to_grabo.minutes_until }} min ({{ mjorn_to_grabo.estimated_time }}){% if mjorn_to_grabo.delay_minutes > 0 %} (+{{ mjorn_to_grabo.delay_minutes }}){% endif %}{% if mjorn_to_grabo.is_cancelled %} - INSTÄLLD{% endif %}</div>
  {% else %}
  <div class="label">Ingen avgång just nu</div>
  {% endif %}

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <div class="label">{{ grabo_to_goteborg.label }}:</div>
  {% if grabo_to_goteborg.has_departure %}
  <div class="label">{{ grabo_to_goteborg.minutes_until }} min ({{ grabo_to_goteborg.estimated_time }}){% if grabo_to_goteborg.delay_minutes > 0 %} (+{{ grabo_to_goteborg.delay_minutes }}){% endif %}{% if grabo_to_goteborg.is_cancelled %} - INSTÄLLD{% endif %}</div>
  {% else %}
  <div class="label">Ingen avgång just nu</div>
  {% endif %}

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <div class="label">BUSSINFO</div>
  {% if mjorn_to_grabo.has_departure %}
  <div class="label">Mjörn: {{ mjorn_to_grabo.bus_name | default: mjorn_to_grabo.line }} - {{ mjorn_to_grabo.bus_location }}</div>
  {% endif %}
  {% if grabo_to_goteborg.has_departure %}
  <div class="label">Gråbo: {{ grabo_to_goteborg.bus_name | default: grabo_to_goteborg.line }} - {{ grabo_to_goteborg.bus_location }}</div>
  {% endif %}

</div>

<div class="title_bar">
  <span class="title">Bussar · Gråbo</span>
  <span class="instance">{{ updated_display }}</span>
</div>
